BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_315240059@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T033321Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T230000
SUMMARY:Play Board Games at the Geekery
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nCome play games at Gamers Geeke
 ry and Tavern every thursday night!\n\nStarting time is 6:30\, but feel fr
 ee to come in anytime and just hang out for the night. Group is very casua
 l and friendly.\n\nHow it works:\nCome on in\, grab a name tag and pay the
  $2.50 meetup participant fee at the bar area\, find the tables that are r
 eserved for the Meetup group\, play games with others who show up. Food an
 d drinks are available at the bar.\n\nPlease RSVP by noon day of. If less 
 than four people are able to attend a given Wednesday the event will be ca
 nceled.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 315240059/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260613T061724Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260613T061724Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_315891830@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T033321Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T200000
SUMMARY:Come Play Games at Gizmo
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Come play games at Gizmo!**\n
 \n**5907 Triangle Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27617**\n\n**One of the organizers wil
 l try and get there early and we will bring a couple of totes of games\; h
 owever\, if there is something you want to play please bring a copy.**\n\n
 **I'm not sure what the exact list will be\, but I know I'll bring Codesna
 mes\, Wizard\, and a couple of other staples. I'm trying to get a good lis
 t of games to include and would love to hear your ideas. Just leave them i
 n the comments and I'll bring what I can.**\n\n**Thanks\,**\n**Lance**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 315891830/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T172740Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T172740Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
